<h2>Exchange Rates &amp; Currency Converter</h2>
<div class="panel panel-default" style="padding:24px;max-width:800px">
    <p><a href="https://frankfurter.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Frankfurter exchange rates</a> · Daily reference rates</p>
    <button class="btn btn-primary" data-action="refreshRates">Update rates</button>
    <p role="status" aria-live="polite" style="margin-top:16px">Loading rates…</p>
    <table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Currency</th><th>Equivalent amount</th></tr></thead><tbody>
        <tr><td>🇺🇸 US Dollar · USD</td><td><input class="form-control" aria-label="USD amount" data-currency="USD" type="number" step="any" disabled></td></tr>
        <tr><td>🇬🇧 British Pound · GBP</td><td><input class="form-control" aria-label="GBP amount" data-currency="GBP" type="number" step="any" disabled></td></tr>
        <tr><td>🇿🇦 South African Rand · ZAR</td><td><input class="form-control" aria-label="ZAR amount" data-currency="ZAR" type="number" step="any" value="1000" disabled></td></tr>
        <tr><td>🇸🇦 Saudi Riyal · SAR</td><td><input class="form-control" aria-label="SAR amount" data-currency="SAR" type="number" step="any" disabled></td></tr>
    </tbody></table>
    <p>Enter an amount in any row to update all the others.</p>
</div>
